# Ketramose: "can't ... block unless there are seven or more cards in exile", and its draw is "during your turn" only. Bot2
# discards an Island at the end of each of its turns 2-10 (five in its graveyard) and casts two Mox Emeralds and a Llanowar Elves with each on turn 12.
# Turn 13, Bot1: Soul-Guide Lantern's enters trigger exiles one Island (Bot1 19) and sacrificing it exiles the other four (5 in
# exile, Bot1 18). Turn 14, Bot2's turn: Bot1 exiles a Llanowar Elves with Swords to Plowshares in Bot2's upkeep (6 in exile) and
# Bot1 does NOT draw or lose life (still 18). Bot2's other Llanowar Elves attacks and with six cards in exile Ketramose can't
# block (no blockers declaration is asked at all). Turn 15: a second Lantern exiles a card of Bot1's own graveyard (7; Bot1 16, after the Elves hit it for 1 on turn 14).
